&lt;p&gt;We bring the same rigor to how we build our team, by empowering our people to move fast, own outcomes, and build something that matters. We take pride in making meaningful investments in our team’s health, wealth, and growth so individuals can thrive as we scale. Our culture values smart, humble, and collaborative teammates who take accountability and drive results in an environment where their work truly moves the business forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are innovative, scaling with purpose, and led by seasoned leaders who know how to build enduring companies. Trusted by brands like Instacart, Western Union, NBCUniversal, ZocDoc, and Sephora, we’re big enough to matter, small enough for you to make a real impact. If you’re excited by the grit of building, rapid learning, and shaping the future of customer growth, you’ll find your place here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: &lt;/strong&gt;At Branch, we&#39;re on a mission to redefine how the world&#39;s largest brands connect with their customers across every platform. Our mobile marketing and deep linking solutions are trusted to power seamless experiences that increase ROI, decrease wasted spend, and eliminate siloed attribution. We&#39;ve gone from high-growth startup to market leader, and we&#39;re continuing to grow with purpose. We&#39;re proud partners with world-class brands including &lt;strong&gt;Tokopedia, &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Malaysia Airlines, Bank Mega Syariah, Shopback, Maxis, Carousell, Airtel&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and more from fast-growing startups to Fortune 500 companies helping them grow their business and sharpen their mobile customer experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here&#39;s why now is the time to join:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;: People are our foundation. Our AE team exemplifies this, boasting exceptional talent density with individuals who are driven, collaborative, and humble, all sharing a commitment to delivering outstanding work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Top-Tier Customers &amp;amp; Global Scale&lt;/strong&gt;: We work with the world&#39;s fastest-growing and most iconic brands, agnostic of vertical, so your work has massive reach and visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seasoned Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: Our executive team includes leaders who&#39;ve taken multiple companies public or to successful acquisition. We&#39;re navigating growth with real experience, not guesswork.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Momentum &amp;amp; High-Impact Stage&lt;/strong&gt;: We&#39;re growing fast, but not bloated. We&#39;re big enough to matter, but small enough for you to make a significant dent with meaningful ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We&#39;re tackling new challenges — cross-platform experiences, privacy-safe attribution, and AI-driven personalization — giving you a chance to shape the next generation of customer growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profitability &amp;amp; Recognized Workplace&lt;/strong&gt;: We&#39;re committed to creating a sustainable, long-term business with a strong foundation, as well as a standout workplace (named a Best Place to Work by Fortune, Inc., Forbes, and Comparably in 2024 and 2025).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As an Enterprise Sales Engineer at Branch, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Pre-Sales Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Enterprise Account Executives on a named list of strategic APAC accounts to understand complex business goals, technical environments, and multi-stakeholder success criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discovery, solution architecture, and executive-level presentations across long, multi-quarter enterprise sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and lead structured proofs of concept and pilots for large organizations, with clearly defined success criteria, milestones, and executive sign-off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical strategy for competitive enterprise deals, including displacement of incumbent MMP/attribution vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Architectural Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the subject matter expert on Branch’s platform, APIs, SDKs, and integration options, including our Journeys, Universal Ads, and Ivy AI product lines, at enterprise scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on enterprise architecture requirements- SSO/SAML, data residency, custom SLAs, and integration with large-scale data warehouses, CDPs, and analytics stacks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on mobile measurement standards (SKAN, AdAttributionKit), ad fraud trends, and evolving privacy regulations across APAC markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Customer Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior technical and business stakeholders — including CTOs, VPs of Growth/Marketing, and Heads of Data — across the customer organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a strategic advisor through renewal and expansion cycles, ensuring enterprise accounts realize measurable ROI and remain reference customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to RFPs, security questionnaires, and vendor risk assessments as a core part of the enterprise sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration, Enablement, and Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product and Engineering to represent enterprise customer requirements, competitive intelligence, and APAC market trends in the product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build enterprise-specific sales engineering playbooks, reference architectures, and demo environments that raise the bar for the broader SE team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor mid-market Sales Engineers on enterprise best practices, complex deal strategy, and executive communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Structure &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will report directly to the Regional General Manager (GM), based in Singapore.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams across Sales and Customer Success to support enterprise growth across the APAC region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position will require travel to customer locations across the APAC region for customer meetings, product demonstrations, solution design sessions, and other enterprise engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll be a strong fit for this role if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in Sales Engineering, Solutions Engineering, or Solutions Consulting, with a track record supporting enterprise-scale (six- and seven-figure ACV) deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success navigating complex, multi-stakeholder, multi-quarter enterprise sales cycles spanning engineering, security, procurement, and legal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of APIs, SDKs, system integrations, and enterprise SaaS/cloud architectures, including SSO/SAML, data residency, and large-scale data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of iOS and Android application development concepts and mobile app architectures; hands-on development experience is a plus but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence and the ability to present technical and business value narratives to C-level and VP-level stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with mobile measurement, attribution, deep linking, or broader marketing technology platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with competing MMP/attribution platforms to support competitive displacement in enterprise deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with discovery and qualification frameworks (e.g., MEDDIC) suited to complex, multi-stakeholder enterprise deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;AI/LLM literacy, with the ability to speak to how AI-driven recommendations and agents work, including data and privacy implications — relevant to Branch’s Ivy product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with retail media and first-party data strategy, useful when selling into large retail and e-commerce enterprises.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Branch&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a strategic book of the largest, most complex accounts in APAC, at the forefront of the AI-powered future of mobile measurement and attribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play a pivotal role in the success and expansion of Branch’s flagship enterprise customers across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation and a comprehensive benefits package, aligned to enterprise deal impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, inclusive culture with real investment in your professional growth and path toward SE leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing opportunities for learning, mentorship, and career development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;The salary range provided represents base compensation and does not include potential equity, which is available for qualifying positions. At Branch, we are committed to the well-being of our team by offering a comprehensive benefits package. From health and wellness programs to paid time off and retirement planning options, we provide a range of benefits for qualified employees. For detailed information on the benefits specific to your position, please consult with your recruiter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
